# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Internal штаб documents. This repository is PUBLIC, so the rule that was a
# precaution on the previous two sites is a hard requirement here.
#
# SPEC.md carries the pricing strategy, the release plan and the wording rules
# about a named competitor. CLAUDE.md carries the working rules. PROGRESS.md
# carries the open questions. None of the three is needed to build the site,
# and history cannot be cleaned after the fact — deleting a file from GitHub
# does not remove it from the history.
#
# They stay on disk, readable between sessions, and never committed.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
SPEC.md
CLAUDE.md
PROGRESS.md
